Example 1:
Input: @operations = ("--x", "x++", "x++")
Output: 1

Operation "--x" =>  0 - 1 => -1
Operation "x++" => -1 + 1 =>  0
Operation "x++" =>  0 + 1 =>  1

Example 2:
Input: @operations = ("x++", "++x", "x++")
Output: 3

Operation "x++" =>  0 + 1 =>  1
Operation "++x" =>  1 + 1 =>  2
Operation "x++" =>  2 + 1 =>  3

Example 3:
Input: @operations = ("x++", "++x", "--x", "x--")
Output: 0

Operation "x++" =>  0 + 1 =>  1
Operation "++x" =>  1 + 1 =>  2
Operation "--x" =>  2 - 1 =>  1
Operation "x--" =>  1 - 1 =>  0
